==English==
{{was wotd|2010|April|27}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|jynx}} in the {{l|en|transferred sense}} “a charm or spell”.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/d͡ʒɪŋks/|a=UK,US}}
* {{audio|en|en-ca-jinx.opus|a=CA}}
* {{audio|en|en-au-jinx.ogg|a=AU}}
* {{homophones|en|jynx}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪŋks|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[hex]]; an [[evil]] [[spell]].
#: {{syn|en|curse|hoodoo|Indian sign|spell}}
# A person or thing supposed to bring [[bad luck]].

