===Interjection===
{{head|en|interjection}}

# {{ng|Used after the same thing is said by two people simultaneously.}} <!-- Often, a game is played where the person who failed to say "jinx" first becomes "jinxed", whereby they cannot speak until someone says their name. -->
#: {{syn|en|snap}}
#* {{quote-av|en|medium=television production|title=The Simpsons|episode=Flaming Moe's|year=1991|season=3|number=10|url=https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0701098/quotes/qt0397691|writer={{w|Robert Cohen (writer)|Robert Cohen}}|passage=Bart: I'm telling Mom and Dad! / Lisa: You're telling who? / Bart: Mom and Dad! / Girls: MOM AND DAD? '''JINX'''! / Janey Powell: Now you can't talk, 'til somebody says your name!}}

